  "answer_text": "$\\mathrm{n} \\pi+\\alpha$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot x\\cdot\\tan\\alpha=1$ ⇒ $\\cot x=\\frac{1}{\\tan\\alpha}=\\cot\\alpha$ ⇒ $x=n\\pi+\\alpha$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cot x=\\cot\\alpha$ ⇒ $x=n\\pi+\\alpha$।\n"
 },
 "87750e1e-d8dd-46d4-ae7f-08ebc4b43e44": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\sqrt{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{-1}(\\sin\\tan^{-1}x)$-এ α=tan⁻¹x: $\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}$।\nRHS: $\\cos^{-1}\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{5}}=\\varphi$ ⇒ $\\tan\\varphi=\\frac{\\sqrt{2/5}}{\\sqrt{3/5}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$।\n∴ $\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$ ⇒ $\\frac{x^{2}}{1+x^{2}}=\\frac{2}{3}$ ⇒ $3x^{2}=2+2x^{2}$ ⇒ $x^{2}=2$ ⇒ $x=\\sqrt{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: x²=2; $\\sqrt{2}$।\n"
 },
 "9696741b-3455-49a2-b7ae-8ac2aec26728": {
