  "answer_text": "$(-\\infty, \\infty)$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$y=\\cot^{-1}x$-এর ডোমেন $(-\\infty,\\infty)$ (সব বাস্তব x)।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: cot⁻¹-এর ডোমেন।\n"
 },
 "21a14cfb-5f89-428b-bacf-e7ab26eee602": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$x$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\alpha=\\cos^{-1}x$ ⇒ $\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}}{x}$।\n$\\beta=\\cot^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}}{x}\\right)$ ⇒ $\\tan\\beta=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}}$ ⇒ $\\sin\\beta=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+1-x^{2}}}=x$।\n∴ মান x।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ধাপে ধাপে; ফল x।\n"
 },
 "3d59e48d-9807-469d-8ea0-4c4d4cbee959": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sec^{-1}2+\\operatorname{cosec}^{-1}2=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ (পূরক কোণ identity)।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পূরক identity।\n"
 },
 "de3f3a81-80cf-48fa-a540-64322ba7ab8d": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$-2 x$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin^{-1}(-\\cos x)=\\sin^{-1}(\\sin(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}))=x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ (উপযুক্ত ব্যাপ্তিতে);\n$\\sin^{-1}(\\cos3x)=\\sin^{-1}(\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-3x))=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-3x$।\nসমষ্টি $=x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\frac{\\pi}{2}-3x=-2x$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2})=-\\cos x$; ফল −2x।\n"
 },
 "03b0897f-c8e8-4ebc-8a1b-02cbb982fe2a": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$x=n \\pi \\pm \\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{2}x+\\sec^{2}x=3$ ⇒ $\\tan^{2}x+1+\\tan^{2}x=3$ ⇒ $2\\tan^{2}x=2$ ⇒ $\\tan^{2}x=1$ ⇒ $\\tan x=\\pm1$।\n∴ $x=n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sec^{2}x=1+\\tan^{2}x$; $x=n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n"
 },
 "aa630dce-6a64-493e-8d92-cce8f6a97c36": {
