  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$A=\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}\\sqrt{1-y^{2}}$ (৬২৪ থেকে), x=$\\frac{1}{3}$, y=$\\frac{1}{4}$:\n$A=\\sqrt{1-\\frac{1}{9}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{1}{16}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{8}{9}}\\sqrt{\\frac{15}{16}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{4}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{30}}{12}=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $A=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$।\n"
 },
 "d68f004b-bb6b-42f2-a0d0-a4566d85196f": {
