 },
 "319c12e8-6761-4b7c-9b52-c4569c446312": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{-\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$p\\left(\\frac{1}{3}x\\right)=\\sin\\left(3\\cdot\\frac{x}{3}\\right)=\\sin x=-1$ ⇒ $x=2n\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\nপ্রদত্ত অপশনে $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ (n=0) ✓।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: sinx=−1; $x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2n\\pi$।\n"
 },
 "7fdbf2f8-d631-41b9-9024-49e90b68851c": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{3}{5}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n৩য় ফাংশন $\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}x$ ধরা হলে:\n$\\sin^{-1}x=2\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$ ⇒ $x=\\sin\\left(2\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{2\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}}{1+\\frac{1}{9}}=\\frac{2/3}{10/9}=\\frac{3}{5}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin2\\theta=\\frac{2t}{1+t^{2}}$; $x=\\frac{3}{5}$।\n"
 },
 "e52d182c-4ced-428a-8bb4-d8073d7ebf07": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "১ম ফাংশন",
  "explanation_text": "\n১ম = $\\cos^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\tan^{-1}2$; ২য় = $\\frac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}\\frac{3}{5}=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$; ৩য় = $\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$।\n১ম − ২য় + ৩য় = $\\tan^{-1}2-\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}2$ = ১ম ফাংশন।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২য় ও ৩য় বাতিল; ফল ১ম ফাংশন।\n"
 },
 "4574d43d-1523-45e8-b424-d33ba8809275": {
